 "remarks": "In the middle of it all! East facing and light-filled one bedroom unit at 140 Grove Street. Stroll to restaurants and downtown Stamford - and less than a mile to Metro North and I-95. Reserved parking, #39, steps away from the stair-free back entrance. Secure building with welcoming lobby, clean and bright shared laundry room, and plenty of visitor parking. Monthly HOA covers heat, water, cooking gas, trash, snow removal, sewer, and grounds. Looking for an investment? Condo is investor friendly and 4G rented for $1,700 per month from 2024-2026. Easy living!",
